              "zh-CN": "修改快捷键后重启 app 验证注册。",
              "en": "After changing shortcuts, restart app and verify registration."
            },
            {
              "zh-CN": "权限缺失状态手动 smoke。",
              "en": "Manual smoke missing-permission state."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
